   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#xa0;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><i>Net Revenue by Category</i>. The following table sets forth the Company&#x2019;s net revenue disaggregated by sales channel and geographic region based on the billing addresses of its customers:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2023-01-01_2023-09-30" name="us-gaap:DisaggregationOfRevenueTableTextBlock" id="B2CBDB37-E3CA-4601-A038-0D4D66BE73CD" escape="true" continuedAt="c2DB8D086-371D-478B-9B5D-83BE34B35FD3">
