   </ix:exclude>
   <ix:exclude>&#xa0;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Midcap Warrant has an exercise price of $<ix:nonFraction id="c104514843" contextRef="i_2021-12-22_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-MidcapWarrantMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="INF">4.70</ix:nonFraction> per share, subject to adjustment for stock splits, reverse stock splits, stock dividends and similar transactions, is immediately exercisable, has a term of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c104514844">ten</span> years from the date of issuance and is exercisable on a cash or cashless basis.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The Company&#x2019;s credit facility consisted of the following as of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022</em> and <em style="font: inherit;"> September 30, 2023</em> (in thousands):</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2023-01-01_2023-09-30" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDebtTableTextBlock" id="c2499326" escape="true">
