   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">As of <em style="font: inherit;"> September 30, 2023</em>, the Company has a liability of $<ix:nonFraction id="c104515257" contextRef="i_2023-09-30_BalanceSheetLocationAxis-AccruedExpensesAndOtherCurrentLiabilitiesMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringReserve" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.2</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million for restructuring costs, of which $<ix:nonFraction id="c104515258" contextRef="i_2023-09-30_BalanceSheetLocationAxis-OtherLiabilitiesMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringReserve" scale="6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">0.1</ix:nonFraction>&#xa0;million is included in accrued expenses and other current liabilities and <em style="font: inherit;">$0.1</em> million&#xa0;is included in other liabilities on the consolidated balance sheet. There were <ix:nonFraction id="c104516752" contextRef="d_2022-01-01_2022-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RestructuringCharges" scale="6" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="-3">no</ix:nonFraction> restructuring costs incurred during the year ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2022.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
