     <td style="width: 1%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; padding-bottom: 3px;"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">)%</p> </td>
