  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The decrease in research and development&#xa0;expenses was primarily the result of a decrease in&#xa0;headcount expense of $0.6 million&#xa0;and a decrease in stock compensation expense of $0.2 million.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
