  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">The decrease in interest expense, net of $0.5&#xa0;million is primarily relating to a decrease in interest expense of $0.4 million and&#xa0;an increase in interest income of $0.1&#xa0;million compared to the prior period due to lower average borrowings.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
