  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The&#xa0;2022 and&#xa0;2023 activity is related to the change in fair market value of the warrant liabilities from the Prefunded Warrants and common stock warrants from our March 2022 equity raise of capital. The change in fair value of warrant liabilities primarily relates to the reduced share price compared to the prior period.</p>
