  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Cost of goods sold decreased by&#xa0;$24.9 million, from&#xa0;$81.1 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2022 to&#xa0;$56.2 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2023 primarily from reduced sales volumes. The decrease in cost of goods sold was primarily attributable to a decrease of $20.7&#xa0;million in cost of goods sold from our organic businesses, a decrease of $3.8&#xa0;million from our M&amp;A businesses,&#xa0;and a decrease of $0.4&#xa0;million in cost of goods sold from our wholesale businesses.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Gross profit&#xa0;decreased from&#xa0;51.2% for the nine months ended September 30, 2022 to&#xa0;48.8% for the nine months ended September 30, 2023. The decrease in gross profit was due primarily to a change of product mix, competitive pricing pressure resulting in reduced retail sales prices, and liquidation of high priced excess inventory at reduced prices.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><b><i>Sales and Distribution Expenses</i></b></p>
